# TAN with PV1_1 = 0, PV1_2 = theta_0 = 70 and no offset (PV1_0 absent):
# the reference point CRVAL sits at native (0, 70) for the celestial
# rotation while the projection keeps (x, y) = (0, 0) at its native pole
# (wcslib celset, offset = 0). Synthetic.
NOTE pipeline: PVi_2 (theta_0) on the longitude axis without offset
GRID 1 512 9 1 512 9
PIX 256.5 256.5
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 512
NAXIS2  = 512
CTYPE1  = 'RA---TAN'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TAN'
CRVAL1  = 120.0
CRVAL2  = 50.0
CRPIX1  = 256.5
CRPIX2  = 256.5
CDELT1  = -0.01
CDELT2  = 0.01
PV1_1   = 0.0
PV1_2   = 70.0
